a-end=\"780\" data-start=\"754\">Password/Date of Birth</strong>, and\u00a0<strong data-end=\"802\" data-start=\"786\">Captcha Code</strong> to download the anwer key.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Question:</strong>\u00a0<strong>What details are mentioned on the admit card?</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Answer:\u00a0</strong>The admit card contains the candidate\u2019s Name, Roll Number, Exam Date, Exam Time, Reporting Time, Exam Centre, Photograph, Signature, and Exam Instructions.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Question:</strong> What is the official website for <b>NTA?</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Answer:</strong> The official website for <strong>NTA</strong><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><strong>\u00a0</strong></span>is <strong>https://csirnet.nta.ac.in/</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p><img alt=\"NTA CSIR UGC NET June Answer Key 2026\" class=\"size-large wp-image-39545 aligncenter\" decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"576\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" src=\"http://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Official-Sarkari-Result-Since-2009-2026-08-10T164153.815-1024x576.jpg\" srcset=\"https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Official-Sarkari-Result-Since-2009-2026-08-10T164153.815-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Official-Sarkari-Result-Since-2009-2026-08-10T164153.815-300x169.jpg 300w, https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Official-Sarkari-Result-Since-2009-2026-08-10T164153.815-768x432.jpg 768w, https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Official-Sarkari-Result-Since-2009-2026-08-10T164153.815.jpg 1200w\" width=\